This product includes software developed by Dragos-Eduard-Gabriel Boncan.
It was extracted and refactored from the author's earlier project,
Eclipse Simulator 3D.

The nine small files allow-listed under data/validation contain reference
values transcribed from public NASA/GSFC eclipse publications and other
identified public references. Each record or manifest retains its source URL.
These files are provided for regression and validation use, not as a complete
or authoritative ephemeris, DEM, or eclipse catalogue.

The local city catalogue, lunar DEM products, ephemeris kernels, neural model
checkpoints, and any other third-party data are not included in the public
package. Their licences, attribution requirements, and redistribution terms
remain separate from the Apache-2.0 licence applying to EclipseKit software.
See docs/DATA_PROVENANCE.md.
